'''Lickitung''' (Japanese: '''ベロリンガ''' ''Beroringa'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

