==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Majestic Dawn|Lickitung|39}} from the {{TCG|Majestic Dawn}} expansion.
*'''Continuous Lick''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Detective Pikachu|Lickitung|16}} from the {{TCG|Detective Pikachu}} subset.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

